<title>USA: Noble Drilling Corp Q1 net sharply higher.</title>
<headline>Noble Drilling Corp Q1 net sharply higher.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>(In thousands, except per share amounts)</p>
<p>							     1997	1996</p>
<p> Operating Revenues				 $168,715 $104,757</p>
<p> Operating Income (a)				 35,062   14,097</p>
<p> Extraordinary Charge, Net of Tax (b)	  (1,704)	---</p>
<p> Net Income					     21,944   10,726</p>
<p> Preferred Stock Dividends			     ---  (1,511)</p>
<p>Net Income Applicable to Common Shares Per Share:</p>
<p>    Income Before Extraordinary Charge	    0.17     0.10</p>
<p>    Extraordinary Charge			    (0.01)	---</p>
<p>    Net Income Per Common Share		     0.16     0.10</p>
<p> Weighted Average Common Shares Outstanding  134,415   95,782</p>
<p>(a)  1996 operating net includes gains of $7.5 million related to the sale of two posted barge rigs, offset by an impairment charge of $7.6 million.</p>
<p>(b)  The amount relates to the company's purchase of $29.6 million principal amount of its 9 1/4% Senior Notes due 2003.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610</p>
</text>
